# checks that we're not emitting any expunges on select, even if the
# mailbox uid set contains holes.
depends messagemix
send 2
a store 1 +flags \deleted
b expunge
receive 4
* 1 FETCH (UID 1 FLAGS (\Deleted \Recent))
a OK done
* 1 EXPUNGE
b OK done
send 1
c unselect
receive 2
* OK [CLOSED] I, missa est
c OK done
send 1
d select inbox
receive 8
* 2 EXISTS
* 0 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 4] next uid
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen \*)] permanent flags
* OK [UIDVALIDITY 1] uid validity
* OK [MAILBOXID (f...)] stable mailbox ID
d OK [READ-WRITE] done
send 1
e noop
receive 1
e OK done
end
